sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/darwin1859-ch13-08> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-08--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-08--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on darwin1859-ch13-08: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.76" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.1.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.755"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "resolvable-now" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.78"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "External similarity, habitat and phylogenetic distance are all measured variables, and molecular trees are independent of the external form being judged. Public trees, morphological matrices and plant trait data cover enough classic and systematic cases to accept or reject the pattern, with plants and invertebrates less evenly coded than vertebrates. The confounding issues are real and are the ordinary ones of comparative methods, not a barrier to a decision." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Measure external morphological similarity, ecological similarity and phylogenetic distance jointly, and test whether distant lineages in similar conditions converge in external form while remaining distant on an independent tree. The claim is confirmed if ecology predicts external resemblance after phylogeny is controlled, and refuted if external resemblance is explained by relatedness alone." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "External form is coded differently in each matrix, so a global resemblance score has to be harmonized.", "Some apparent convergence is retained deep homology that a coarse ecological label misclassifies.", "Similar climate is only a proxy for the 'similar conditions' that actually shaped the external parts." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch13-08--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch13-08--grok--dataset-2>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch13-08--grok--dataset-3> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-08--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of darwin1859-ch13-08 by Grok 4.7: 0.85" ;
